@Enhanzer_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5068

GET {{Enhanzer_API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Retrieve locations
GET {{Enhanzer_API_HostAddress}}/api/locations
Accept: application/json

###

### Login (returns 501 until an authentication provider is configured)
POST {{Enhanzer_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "replace-with-a-real-password"
}

###
